( Ordinary local state: Bram 10 phase, 11 wait-request, 12 sealed,
  13 page location. Two local progression functions, no messages or simulated
  per-machine scheduler. One finite scene: fetching / approaching / handing
  over, interleaved with Bram's checking / sealing / finishing round. )
@ask-bram
 #10 LDZ #02 LTH ?ask-in-time !report
 @ask-in-time #01 #11 STZ
 @report #13 LDZ !account
@incident
 ;cora-progress JSR2 ;bram-progress JSR2
 ;cora-progress JSR2 ;bram-progress JSR2
 ;cora-progress JSR2 ;bram-progress JSR2
 #13 LDZ !returned
@cora-progress
 #0c LDZ INC #0c STZ
 #0c LDZ #03 NEQ ?cora-done
 #02 #12 LDZ SUB #13 STZ
 @cora-done JMP2r
@bram-progress
 #10 LDZ INC #10 STZ
 #10 LDZ #02 EQU ?seal-maybe
 #10 LDZ #03 NEQ ?bram-done
 #01 #12 STZ JMP2r
 @seal-maybe #11 LDZ ?bram-done #01 #12 STZ
 @bram-done JMP2r
